{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"It is safe.","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:09:25.328000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737914662485491729","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"How long have you known?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:09:43.649000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737914739329597531","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"The masons and the dawn are two branches of a single tree. We know them as they know us.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:10:45.172000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737914997375631401","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"I...\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:11:47.266000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737915257816743976","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"Goanhawe. What are you doing?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:12:21.668000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737915402109321247","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"I just wanted to get to the island. I knew what I had signed up with, but it went so bad, so quickly.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:13:21.742000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737915654077808690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"You are short lived. But that doesn't mean you have to be short sighted. What were you planning to do on the island if those you come with are not there to support you?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:14:15.058000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737915877701451787","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"You know, even until today, I thought I could fool them? That I could live among them even while serving Solomon?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:19:55.352000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737917304997937173","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"And now?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:20:11.114000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737917371108556912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"Of course not.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:21:22.983000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737917672548859954","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"Do you know the details already?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:23:15.154000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737918143028133956","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"Of Rah's death.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:23:26.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737918189727383663","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"I am a master of Divination. The second highest of my order, and I hired the gnome who designed this submarine. There is little I don't know other than its mechanical working. The ship is more than just a place. It is a struggle that reveals a person.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:25:20.938000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737918670604337202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"I've spent the past few days blaming him for everything that's happened. For all the hurt I've been causing.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:26:46.407000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737919029087305749","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"But a person can only be who they are at the moment even if their past follows them. At this moment you are not the man struggling to survive. I speak with you with out bars between us, as an equal.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:27:00.779000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T06:27:08.391000Z","id":"737919089368104991","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"I feared he had killed us all, and I thought I could undo it, not without harm, but without violence.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:28:30.573000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737919465991176222","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"And now, even if I survive the trial I don't think I can protect the other members of the Golden Dawn.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:29:19.220000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737919670031745092","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"I don't think I can protect Castor and Amara.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:29:36.016000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737919740479275018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"And there is another, not yet a member, but under consideration.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:33:07.633000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737920628065042433","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"Castor is redeemed and guarded by the Roi du Solei. He asked me for sanctuary for Amara, which of course was freely given.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:35:56.883000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737921337950994444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"You know what Solomon did to Rah. Was he not a mason?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:37:36.281000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737921754856423466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"Rah was seeking to be a part of all four secret societies. An agent of chaos and a true friend to all.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:38:59.261000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T06:40:04.331000Z","id":"737922102899769345","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"He wasn't protected.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:40:47.918000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737922558640521296","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"Wasn't he? Weren't you? No protection from mortals can prevent all mortal danger. Safety increases but only intention protects.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:42:01.236000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737922866158501931","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"Goanhawe nods.","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:43:07.003000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737923142005293136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"I want to continue to work to protect the other members of the Golden Dawn, Castor, and Amara.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:43:59.376000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737923361673576538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"All this time, the only way I could see to do that was to serve Solomon. Appease him.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:44:17.783000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737923438877999105","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"And the one who is mine and the one who is not.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:45:55.818000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737923850066460685","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"Goanhawe nods. \"And the one under consideration.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:46:47.615000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737924067318824980","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"We all participated when the simulacrum attacked the sub. We all saw the death that Solomon wrought and joined anyway. Why are you helping so many who are so guilty?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:47:51.721000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737924336199139338","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"It seems as though you have set your intention. To protect the Design whose intention was good. As you protect those beneath your wings, how can you not see that I am too?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:48:44.229000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T06:50:55.548000Z","id":"737924556433653933","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"Goanhawe thinks for a moment.","created_at":"2020-07-29T06:57:10.676000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737926680626200677","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"Solomon will continue to bribe, cajole, threaten, and kill to see his will done. Even if we somehow were to disband the Golden Dawn within the ship, he can still potentially abuse other colonists to see his will done.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:01:52.165000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737927861276508171","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"The Golden Dawn is not merely a tradition. It its what wears down the foundations of culture the way the wind wears down the mountain. He will abuse as his master aberrates all that he touches. The Hunger.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:07:06.876000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737929181270245449","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"The Hunger?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:07:23.327000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737929250270740532","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"The Hunger is the will of a creature unlike any other. Though the Abyss is endless, it is written that there comes a point as you descend where can exist nothing worse than he.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:10:04.029000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T07:12:34.821000Z","id":"737929924303912980","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"But. Is this the conversation you really want to have? The dead is dead. The danger is dangerous. All you control is what you do next.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:16:45.514000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737931608253792378","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"I do not know which conversation I want to have. I am guilty of the crime I am accused of. None of us will ever be truly safe from Solomon. Amara will always have Castor and Ophelia as strings to pull, and so I have doomed her to service in the Golden Dawn.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:23:54.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737933407182651454","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"Do you seek punishment or clemency? I can provide either.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:24:50.498000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737933642424385596","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"I don't want to do anymore harm.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:42:54.975000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737938191050604546","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"Then don't, but you can't leave here safely. I offer you a mark of my protection.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:43:30.934000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T07:43:53.034000Z","id":"737938341873582150","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"It is more than I deserve.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:46:15.349000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737939031479943208","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"He touches the end of the beak with the tip of his claw.\nEnergy flows through you and begins to mark you chest.\n\nIlluminator’s Tattoo\nWondrous item (tattoo), common (requires\nattunement)\nThis tattoo contains beautiful calligraphy, images\nof writing implements in a masonic design.\nWhile this tattoo is on your skin, you can write with your\nfingertip as if it were an ink pen that never runs\nout of ink.\nAs an action, you can touch a piece of writing\nup to one page in length and speak a creature’s\nname. The writing becomes invisible to everyone\nother than you and the named creature for the\nnext 24 hours. Either of you can dismiss the\ninvisibility by touching the script (no action\nrequired). Once used, this action can’t be used\nagain until the next dawn.","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:49:45.516000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T07:50:13.908000Z","id":"737939912984363079","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"He leaves you a stack of paper. \"I will speak what ever you write to Amaya and vouch for your reform.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:51:26.188000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737940335233204285","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"Thank you for coming to see me.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:52:19.679000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737940559590719508","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"737736733948379228","content":"\"As a formality I must ask that you step back in your cell. Though imprisonment is abhorrent to me.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T07:53:36.934000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737940883621675049","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
